---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-navy text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About Us</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        A legacy of management excellence, evolving for the modern workplace.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder Legacy -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="h-1 w-12 bg-gold rounded"></div>
          <span class="text-gold font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Founder Legacy</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-8">Shri R. K. Rawat</h2>

        <div class="prose max-w-none text-navy/70 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-navy">Shri R. K. Rawat</strong> (B.Com, MBA &mdash; IIM Calcutta) was a visionary management professional
            who founded Bombay Academy of Management Studies in 1986 with a singular mission: to bring world-class
            management training to Indian corporates.
          </p>

          <p>
            With a distinguished career spanning organisations like <strong class="text-navy">Maruti Udyog Ltd</strong>,
            <strong class="text-navy">Aditya Birla Group of Industries</strong>, <strong class="text-navy">Daewoo Motors</strong>,
            <strong class="text-navy">Marico Industries</strong>, <strong class="text-navy">Ajmera Constructions</strong>, and
            <strong class="text-navy">Four Seasons Industry (Lagos, Nigeria)</strong>, he brought decades of real-world corporate
            experience to every training program.
          </p>

          <p>
            Under his leadership, BAMS conducted executive training programs across India at premium venues,
            partnering with leading corporations including Siemens, Pidilite Industries, Indian Oil Corporation,
            and Bharat Petroleum. The programs covered export-import management, finance, negotiation skills,
            purchase management, and strategic selling &mdash; building capabilities in thousands of professionals.
          </p>

          <p>
            His vision was clear: training should be practical, grounded in real business experience, and
            delivered with the rigour of top academic institutions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Divider -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <hr class="border-navy/10" />
  </div>

  <!-- The New Chapter -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="h-1 w-12 bg-teal rounded"></div>
          <span class="text-teal font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">The New Chapter</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-8">Archana Rawat</h2>

        <div class="prose max-w-none text-navy/70 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-navy">Archana Rawat</strong> (B.E. Electrical &mdash; NIT Nagpur, MBA &mdash; IIM Ahmedabad)
            served as Director, Academic Services at BAMS, working alongside the founder to design and deliver
            training programs for India's top corporates.
          </p>

          <p>
            With a unique combination of engineering precision, management expertise, and deep study of
            human psychology, Archana now leads BAMS into its next evolution: <strong class="text-navy">Corporate
            Mind Management & Emotional Wellness</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Today's programs integrate:
          </p>

          <ul class="list-none space-y-3 pl-0">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal mt-2.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong class="text-navy">Stress Management</strong> &mdash; evidence-based techniques for high-pressure environments</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal mt-2.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong class="text-navy">Breathwork & Meditation</strong> &mdash; practical tools for emotional regulation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal mt-2.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong class="text-navy">Subconscious Conditioning</strong> &mdash; reshaping mental patterns for sustained performance</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal mt-2.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong class="text-navy">Mind Mastery</strong> &mdash; clarity, focus, and emotional resilience for leadership</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            This is not generic wellness content. It is rigorous, experiential, and designed specifically for
            corporate professionals who need practical tools to perform at their best.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Credentials Banner -->
  <section class="bg-cream py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-navy mb-4">Founder Credentials</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-navy/70">
            <li>B.Com</li>
            <li>MBA &mdash; IIM Calcutta</li>
            <li>Corporate leadership across India & abroad</li>
            <li>35+ years management training experience</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-navy mb-4">Current Leadership</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-navy/70">
            <li>B.E. (Electrical) &mdash; NIT Nagpur</li>
            <li>MBA &mdash; IIM Ahmedabad</li>
            <li>Director, Academic Services (BAMS)</li>
            <li>Corporate mind management specialist</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
